<h2 style="margin-top:0;font-size:18px;color:#0f172a;">Password Reset Request</h2>
<p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your password for your Hospital Care System account.</p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
  <a href="{{{resetLink}}}" class="button" target="_blank" style="font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;">Reset My
    Password</a>
</div>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#64748b;text-align:center;">
  Or use this security token if prompted:
</p>
<div class="code-box">{{resetCode}}</div>

<p
  style="font-size:13px;color:#dc2626;background-color:#fef2f2;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #fee2e2;">
  ⚠️ This link and security token will expire in <strong>{{expiresInMinutes}} minutes</strong>.
</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#64748b;margin-top:20px;">
  If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email or contact support if you suspect unauthorized
  activity.
</p>